The '''Ruins''' (also known as '''Castle''') is a location on the [[Hub Island]], which is home to aggressive {{MobSprite|Wolf;Wolves}}.

{{ZoneText|Explore the ancient ruins.|Watch out for the guard dogs!}}

== Functions ==
The '''Ruins''' is found to the left of the launch pad to [[The Park]]. 

It contains {{MobSprite|Wolf;Wolves}} and {{MobSprite|Old Wolf;Old Wolves}}, and is one of the locations at which the {{MobSprite|Sven Packmaster}} is spawned to complete [[Wolf Slayer]] quests, though the {{Zone|Howling Cave}} may be a better choice, because the Wolves there grant more {{Skill|Combat|XP}}.

The {{NPCSprite|Lonely Philosopher}} is also located here, who sells {{Item|Travel Scroll to Hub Castle}}.

